**Evaluating test coverage**

I'm thinking about the existing tests and whether they cover everything important. They seem to assess menu functions, drag actions, cancellation, and boundaries. I wonder if they sufficiently address the first and last items for menus. There's also consideration for long documents and auto-scrolling, but it looks like current tests only focus on text selection, not block dragging. I should look into including block drag long document auto-scrolling tests and check if core command tests are adequately inspected.
